  ('clothing', 'Clothing', 'All Carter''s. Carter''s UAE had 30% off online when checked; sale price shown in brackets.', 6, 570, 1450),
  ('extras-and-inspiration', 'Extras & inspiration', 'From the inspiration pictures. Momcozy prices from Carrefour UAE / Centrepoint; the rest are estimates. Monitor and stroller are covered above.', 7, 1190, 6800)
